SUMMARY:Steam Era Labour Day Weekend
DESCRIPTION:Steam-Era is this Labour Day weekend! \nJoin us for four unforgettable days at Steam-Era 2026\, one of Canada’s premier heritage machinery shows. Presented by the Ontario Steam & Antique Preservers Association\, Steam-Era brings history to life with working displays\, exciting demonstrations\, and family fun. \nExperience one of Ontario’s largest collections of century-old steam driven tractors and engines at work. See the evolution from these massive beasts to the modern tractor. Visitors can experience live demonstrations of antique sawmills\, threshing\, and plowing\, alongside a vibrant trading post\, vendor markets\, military heritage displays\, and incredible truck and tractor pulls. Families love the daily equipment parades\, model steam engine displays\, the corn shelling and rope making. If you’re a history enthusiast\, machinery fan\, or simply looking for a unique family outing\, there’s something for everyone to enjoy
URL:https://ontariohistoricalsociety.ca/event/steam-era-labour-day-weekend/
LOCATION:9313 Fourth Line\, 9313 Fourth Line\, Halton Hills\, ON\, L9T 2X9\, Canada
END:VEVENT
