SUMMARY:Oakville Historical Society - Art in My Garden
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy an afternoon of art appreciation. Meet 70 artists sharing 100’s of art originals across 35 gardens. Local artists’ work will be on display at the Thomas House porch (located in Lakeside Park) and the Steve Nease cartoon collection at OHS office (located at 110 King Street) is featured.
